WEBVTT

00:08:59.618 --> 00:09:03.163
to accelerate their development pathway
and climate adaptation.

00:09:04.873 --> 00:09:06.083
But.

00:09:07.167 --> 00:09:12.214
Many of these countries also have
very real overlapping risk profiles.

00:09:14.049 --> 00:09:16.635
The International Institute
for Sustainable Development

00:09:16.635 --> 00:09:19.305
first produced this map back in 2018.

00:09:20.472 --> 00:09:22.891
Can you see the green dots on the map?

00:09:22.933 --> 00:09:25.394
They represent all
of the different materials

00:09:25.436 --> 00:09:27.646
that we need in order to decarbonize,

00:09:27.688 --> 00:09:30.733
their geographic location
and their deposit size.